                            <Paragraph Style="{StaticResource H3}">特性 &amp; 用途</Paragraph>
                            <List>
<ListItem><Paragraph Foreground="{DynamicResource ColorBrush1}">其部分区域低于海平面，因而被<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%B0%B4" Margin="0,0,0,-8">水</local:MyTextButton></Underline>覆盖，位于海平面的陆地边缘多生成一格深的低洼<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%B0%B4" Margin="0,0,0,-8">水</local:MyTextButton></Underline>池；<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E5%8C%96%E7%9F%B3" Margin="0,0,0,-8">化石</local:MyTextButton></Underline>可以在此生成，但<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%B2%BC%E6%B3%BD%E5%B0%8F%E5%B1%8B" Margin="0,0,0,-8">沼泽小屋</local:MyTextButton></Underline>不在此生成。</Paragraph></ListItem>
<ListItem><Paragraph Foreground="{DynamicResource ColorBrush1}"><Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E7%BA%A2%E6%A0%91%E6%9E%97%E6%B2%BC%E6%B3%BD" Margin="0,0,0,-8">红树林沼泽</local:MyTextButton></Underline>的草色与普通<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%B2%BC%E6%B3%BD" Margin="0,0,0,-8">沼泽</local:MyTextButton></Underline>相同，但<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%A0%91%E5%8F%B6" Margin="0,0,0,-8">树叶</local:MyTextButton></Underline>和<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E8%97%A4%E8%94%93" Margin="0,0,0,-8">藤蔓</local:MyTextButton></Underline>具有独特的浅绿色调，且<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%B0%B4" Margin="0,0,0,-8">水</local:MyTextButton></Underline>呈青色而不是灰绿色。</Paragraph></ListItem>
<ListItem><Paragraph Foreground="{DynamicResource ColorBrush1}"><Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E7%BA%A2%E6%A0%91%E6%9E%97%E6%B2%BC%E6%B3%BD" Margin="0,0,0,-8">红树林沼泽</local:MyTextButton></Underline>通常会与<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E4%B8%9B%E6%9E%97" Margin="0,0,0,-8">丛林</local:MyTextButton></Underline>或<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%B2%99%E6%BC%A0" Margin="0,0,0,-8">沙漠</local:MyTextButton></Underline>邻接，植被以大量的<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E7%BA%A2%E6%A0%91" Margin="0,0,0,-8">红树</local:MyTextButton></Underline>为特征，高矮不一，<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%A0%91%E5%8F%B6" Margin="0,0,0,-8">树叶</local:MyTextButton></Underline>极为茂密，地面由<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%B3%A5%E5%B7%B4" Margin="0,0,0,-8">泥巴</local:MyTextButton></Underline>和少量的草方块构成。</Paragraph></ListItem>
<ListItem><Paragraph Foreground="{DynamicResource ColorBrush1}"><Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E7%BA%A2%E6%A0%91%E6%9E%97%E6%B2%BC%E6%B3%BD" Margin="0,0,0,-8">红树林沼泽</local:MyTextButton></Underline>中会自然生成<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E7%83%AD%E5%B8%A6%E9%B1%BC" Margin="0,0,0,-8">热带鱼</local:MyTextButton></Underline>、热带变种的<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E9%9D%92%E8%9B%99" Margin="0,0,0,-8">青蛙</local:MyTextButton></Underline>以及<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E9%AA%B7%E9%AB%85" Margin="0,0,0,-8">骷髅</local:MyTextButton></Underline>的特殊变种<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E6%B2%BC%E9%AA%B8" Margin="0,0,0,-8">沼骸</local:MyTextButton></Underline>。</Paragraph></ListItem>
<ListItem><Paragraph Foreground="{DynamicResource ColorBrush1}">根据月相变化<Underline><local:MyTextButton EventType="打开网页" EventData="https://zh.minecraft.wiki/w/%E5%8F%B2%E8%8E%B1%E5%A7%86" Margin="0,0,0,-8">史莱姆</local:MyTextButton></Underline>可以在晚上的Y=50到Y=70之间生成。</Paragraph></ListItem>
</List>
